        #tdZYmb4GaAcFEb5aqNe30wWh ^"Coated with Ichor" DEF {
            EXTENDS ^"Stat Block Feature"
            ^"Category" STRING "Trait"
            ^"Description" STRING "A creature that touches the plague stricken or hits it with a melee attack while within 5 feet of it takes 2 (1d4) Poison damage and must succeed on a Strength saving throw (DC 11) to keep its weapon. The creature can reroll this saving throw to pull back a weapon stuck in plague stricken ichor."
