            EXTENDS ^"Stat Block Feature"
            ^"Category" STRING "Trait"
            ^"Description" STRING "Any creature who strikes plague stricken with a slashing or a piercing weapon from 5 feet will be infested with worms. To avoid this the creature needs to roll a Dexterity (Acrobatics) check on DC 12. The worms will deal 1 point of Necrotic damage to the creature infested each round unless the creature uses an action to remove them. Multiple worms deal more than 1 Necrotic damage each round but all can be removed with one action. If a creature drops to 0 HP with this effect the creature will raise as a **sentient plague stricken** in the next 24 hours."
        }
        #tw7xJLVNefFDvkCpsTbzVpc4 ^"Eternal Vigor" DEF {
            EXTENDS ^"Stat Block Feature"
